Platform Goals
--------------------------------------------------------------------
  =>Support 250+ engineers across 20–50+ teams.
  =>Enable true multi-tenancy (team isolation + shared efficiency).
  =>Provide self-service CI/CD.
  =>Enforce security, compliance, and standards by default.
  =>Scale horizontally with minimal platform team effort

#Multi-tenancy isolation strategy and security :
--------------------------------------------------------------------

1.Namespaces (EKS): Separate namespaces per team to prevent resource interference.
2.Resource Quotas: Limit CPU, memory, and storage per namespace.
3.RBAC: Fine-grained role-based access control per team.
4.Network Policies: Control Pod-to-Pod communication.
5.Security Groups: Only required ports open, e.g., ALB → Pods, Pods → RDS/S3.


#Scalability approach (20 → 50+ teams):
-----------------------------------------------------------
1.Horizontal Scaling:
  -------------------
EKS Worker Nodes auto-scaled with Cluster Autoscaler.
ECS Tasks scale via Service Auto Scaling.

2.Namespace Expansion:
 --------------------
Each team gets its own namespace without affecting others.

3.CI/CD Scaling:
 ----------------
Terraform pipelines modularized per team.
Shared artifact storage (S3) handles growth.

4)Storage Scaling:
-----------------
RDS Read Replicas.
S3 scales virtually unlimited.



| Dimension    | ~20 Teams             | 50+ Teams                         |
| ------------ | --------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| Clusters     | 1–2 shared clusters   | Multiple clusters per environment |
| Isolation    | Namespace-level       | Cluster + namespace               |
| CI/CD        | Mostly shared runners | Tiered + dedicated runners        |
| Blast Radius | Medium                | Small                             |
| Scaling Unit | Nodes                 | Clusters                          |
| Ops Load     | Manual + automated    | Fully automated                   |


